@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@studentToken = REPLACE_WITH_STUDENT_TOKEN
@activityId = 1
@offerId = 1
@notificationId = 1

### 普通报名，满额自动加入候补
POST {{baseUrl}}/activities/{{activityId}}/registrations
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"joinWaitlistIfFull":true}

### 查看当前候补；将响应 offerId 填到顶部
GET {{baseUrl}}/activities/{{activityId}}/waitlist/me
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 站内通知
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me/waitlist-notifications?afterId=0&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 邀请详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/waitlist-offers/{{offerId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 确认邀请；与拒绝请求二选一
POST {{baseUrl}}/waitlist-offers/{{offerId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 拒绝邀请
POST {{baseUrl}}/waitlist-offers/{{offerId}}/decline
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 通知已读
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/waitlist-notifications/{{notificationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
